## About the standard

SS-EN 54-1 defines terminology used throughout the EN 54 series and explains the principles behind its parts. It describes the functions of components in fire detection and alarm systems.

The series concerns systems in buildings and civil engineering works. Domestic smoke alarms are covered by other standards, including EN 14604.

Official source: [SS-EN 54-1:2021](https://www.sis.se/produkter/miljo-och-halsoskydd-sakerhet/skydd-mot-brand/brandskydd/ss-en-54-120212/).
